Users must comply with ABIDE data use terms when using this software
with ABIDE data. The ABIDE data themselves are NOT included in this repository.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
CLINICAL DISCLAIMER
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
This software is intended for RESEARCH PURPOSES ONLY. It is not a medical
device and has not been approved by any regulatory authority for clinical use.
The system sensitivity (0.652) does not meet clinical screening thresholds.
Do not use for autonomous diagnostic decisions. Always consult qualified
medical professionals for ASD diagnosis and treatment decisions.
